        {
          "lang": "zh-TW",
          "lang_word": "Diego",
          "definition": "n. 迭戈（西班牙語系男子名,Santiago 的略稱）"
        }
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "Diego will represent our office at the Latin America sales summit.",
