            "zh-TW": "迭戈將代表我們的辦公室出席拉丁美洲業務高峰會。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "Could you please forward the contract draft to Diego for legal review?",
          "highlight": [
            "Diego"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "可以請你把合約草稿轉寄給迭戈做法律審閱嗎?"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "Diego has managed the Mexican subsidiary since the company was founded.",
          "highlight": [
            "Diego"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "迭戈自公司成立以來一直管理墨西哥子公司。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "synonyms": [
        "Santiago"
      ],
